---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Contact VisaPath.pk"
  description="Get in touch with VisaPath.pk for feedback, corrections, or partnership inquiries."
>
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-10 prose">
    <h1>Contact Us</h1>
    <p>
      Questions about our tools? Found an error in one of our guides? Want to partner with us? We would love to hear from you.
    </p>
    <h2>Email</h2>
    <p>
      <a href="mailto:hello@visapath.pk">hello@visapath.pk</a>
    </p>
    <h2>What to Expect</h2>
    <p>
      We read every email and typically respond within 2–3 business days. For urgent visa queries, please contact your embassy directly or consult a licensed immigration advisor.
    </p>
    <h2>Important Notice</h2>
    <p>
      VisaPath.pk is an information website only. We do not process visa applications, provide legal advice, or guarantee visa approval. All information is for reference only — always verify current requirements with the official embassy of your destination country.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
